      coord init
      coord add --role R --scope S --title T [--project P] [--ref R] [--goal ID]
      coord goal add --title T [--ref R] [--base BRANCH]   create a goal, its branch and its worktree
      coord goal list                      list open goals
      coord goal show ID                   show a goal and its tasks
      coord goal sync ID                   merge the base branch into the goal branch
      coord goal done ID                   close a goal (refused while a task is open or the goal lacks the base head)
      coord goal pr ID                     push the goal branch as the GitHub bot and open or update its pull request
      coord review-watch [--once] [--interval S]
                                           send new reviews of goal pull requests to the architect;
                                           close a goal and run gc --yes after its pull request merges
      coord land ID [--subject TEXT]       squash a done task branch into its goal branch, then delete the task branch
      coord reap [--minutes N]             release the claims of workers not seen for N minutes
                                           (default: team.reap_minutes, else 90; a live dispatcher is never released)
      coord gc [--yes]                     list (or with --yes delete) merged flow branches and finished goal worktrees
      coord show ID                        show one task: its fields and its annotations
      coord start-task ID                  check out branch task/<id> from its goal branch
      coord next [ROLE] [--mine] [--wait [--interval S] [--timeout S]]
